Hmmm... this raises the question, "What did humans evolve to do?"  If not
"shape their environment to their own desires", then what?  If
survival-oriented evolution did not give us this desire to control our
environment, then what did?  God?  (If you believe this, please buy GOD on
HEx... and I have some swampland in Utah to show you as well...)  So I
